                                                "sense_id": "7a4b5205-80b5-3d46-9a60-06257e6ca42b",
                                                "text": "[...] 4,000 tons of slabs will be sent to the R.T.B. works at Ebbw Vale and a further 8,000 a week will be rolled at the new R.T.B. Newport Works and returned to the Steel Co. of Wales at Trostre and Llangyfelach in coil form for processing into tinplate."
